        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beli na Nebo baruhanga ba Babiloni, bafukamire ahansi; ebihuuku byabo bili aha migongo y'endogobe n'ebitunganwa. Ebintu ebyo mwekolera mbwenu byabaire migugu, bili aha migongo y'endogobe byazilemesize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebihuuku tibina gerokora; babikwete babitwara. Aga nigo maheleruka gabyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumpulilize inywe baana ba Yakobo, inywe nywena abaana ba Isiraeli abasigaire oruguru. Nkabezalira muba baana bange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muliba bagurusi nkyali Ruhanga wanyu, mulimerwa enjwi mukyali baana bange. Nkabatonda mara ndatulindaga, kandi ndabajunaga nshube mbarokore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakunshusa ohai, anga mwakunyiganisa n'ohai, handiki mwakundenga ahali ohai owo ndikwigana nawe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bafukunkura ezahabu omu nshaho, n'efeza bagipima aha munzani, baziha omuhesi w'ezahabu aziheshamu ruhanga, bagwa ahansi bamufukamira! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekihuuku ekyo bakishutulira aha mabega bakyetweka, kyonene tikyakweihya mtuli kili. Omuntu tiyakukitakira kikamuhorora anga kikamujuna mu matangwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwijuke ekigambo eki mukyekomeleze, mukite aha njoka inywe bafakare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eby'eirai ebya karai mubijuke. Ruhanga aba inye ondijo taliho. N'inye Ruhanga, ow'okunshusha taliho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebilibaho aha nzindo nkabigamba aha mbandizo. Kuruga akarai aka karai nkagamba ebilibaho. Ebyo ngendeleire bilibaho, mara byona ebyo ndikwenda ndibikora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyesire eihungu kuruga oburugaizoba, omuntu owo nyerondeire kuruga omu nsi eli harai. Nagambire mara ebyo ngambire ndabigobesheleza; ebyo ndaliire ndabikora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe bagumangani b'emitima mumpulilize, inywe abatetaireho n'akake kuba bagorogoki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndi haihi muno kuboleka okwo ndi mugorogoki, ndi hagufi muno kubarokora. Ninyija kurokora Sioni aha rwa Isiraeli ekitinwa kyange.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
